CHANGELOG
=========

v2.0-safe (2026-11-02)
----------------------
CRITICAL FIXES (8):
  • Isolated firewall rules in CM_* chains (INPUT, FORWARD, DNAT, SNAT)
    → Prevents accidental deletion of UFW/Docker/Fail2ban rules
  • Removed UFW DEFAULT_FORWARD_POLICY modification
    → Preserves global firewall security policy
  • Scoped MASQUERADE rule to target IP only
    → Prevents interference with other services
  • Implemented 3-level SSH port detection (sshd -T + ss + config)
    → Reliable protection against SSH blocking
  • Fixed lock_port_to_ip() to use FORWARD chain
    → IP restrictions now work correctly for DNAT traffic
  • Backup only saves CM_* chains as timestamped tarball
    → Prevents overwriting UFW/Docker/Fail2ban rules
  • Restore only applies CM_* chains
    → Safe recovery of own rules without touching other services
  • Uninstall removes only CM_* components
    → Server remains fully operational after removal

ADDITIONAL IMPROVEMENTS (6):
  • Enhanced IPv4 validation (format + octet range)
  • Enhanced IPv6 validation (improved regex with :: support)
  • Port range validation (1-65535)
  • TCP/UDP port reachability checks
  • Error handling on all critical operations
  • Automatic CRLF → LF line ending normalization

