MIGRATION NOTES
===============

From v1.x to v2.0-safe:
  1. First run of v2.0 automatically detects v1.x rules
  2. Migrates existing DNAT rules to CM_DNAT_RULES chain
  3. Preserves all socat IPv4→IPv6 services
  4. Creates migration marker to prevent re-migration
  5. No user action required - transparent upgrade

Rollback to v1.x:
  1. Save current state: compmaniya --option 11 (backup)
  2. Remove v2.0: compmaniya --option 13 (uninstall)
  3. Install v1.0: checkout old version from git
  4. Restore backup: ./install.sh → option 12
  ⚠️ NOT RECOMMENDED - v2.0 is significantly more secure

